        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat exchanger of cogen unit 160kWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat exchanger of cogen unit 160kWe
Inventory refers to infrastructure of an existing natural gas cogeneration plant (lambda=1 motor, 160kWe, operation start 1987) at Jakobsberg, Basel, Switzerland. (Life time for operation assumed 80'000 h).;
UUID: d49cecdc-f98d-32cb-972d-ef57d8b90820
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the water needed for production
Location: Data refers to a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER)
Technology: Component of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Technology at end of 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d49cecdc-f98d-32cb-972d-ef57d8b90820.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
